      "writtenOn": "2021-10-19T22:25:03Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Why do we find the prevDrawOrder for opaque objects? I thought those didn\u0027t matter.\n\nAnd do we want different orders for color/depth and stencil? Will there be a separate bounds manager for stencils?",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 208,
        "startChar": 28,
        "endLine": 208,
        "endChar": 41
      },
      "revId": "d19b245806c9b61df47ecf496ae736b6ef4acb36",
